---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Hosting for Portfolio Under ₹2000/yr - SetupKaro";
const desc = "You need 1 page + contact + fast load. Don't buy ₹8000 VPS.";
---
<Layout title={title} desc={desc} crumbs={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Guides',href:'/#tools'},{label:'Hosting for Portfolio'}]}>
<main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
<div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border mt-4 p-6 sm:p-8">
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500">By Noyel G • Updated 6 Sept 2026 • Affiliate disclosure applies</div>
<h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mt-1">Hosting for portfolio under ₹2000/yr?</h1>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">You need 1 page + contact + fast load. Don't buy ₹8000 VPS.</p>

<div class="border rounded-2xl p-5 mt-5 max-w-xl">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 font-extrabold text-xl w-11 h-11 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl">H</span>
<div class="font-bold">Hostinger Single / Premium</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3 text-xs font-semibold">
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">✓ 1-click setup</span>
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">✓ Free SSL</span>
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">⌨ INR pricing</span>
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">✓ 30-day refund</span>
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">✓ Free domain (12-mo+)</span>
</div>
<div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3">Renewal ₹1500–3500/yr</div>
<a href="#" rel="nofollow sponsored" class="inline-block bg-gray-900 text-white text-sm font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl mt-2">Check Hostinger price →</a>
</div>

<div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-4 mt-4 text-sm leading-7 max-w-xl">
<span class="font-bold">ⓘ Renewal trap:</span> First year ₹149/mo, renewal ₹299/mo. Buy 12-month minimum, 48-month if sure. Set calendar reminder 30 days before renewal.
</div>

<details class="border rounded-2xl p-4 mt-4 text-sm max-w-xl">
<summary class="font-bold cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-2">☁️ Free alternative: Cloudflare Pages <span class="ml-auto">⌄</span></summary>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">This site runs on it, ₹0. Use if you can code. Use Hostinger if you want 1-click + support.</p>
</details>
</div>
</main>
</Layout>
